{"task":{"id":"functional","spec":"Write synthesizable SystemVerilog for exactly one module named counter with ports input wire clk, input wire rst, output reg [3:0] count.
On each rising edge of clk, synchronously set count to 4'b0000 if rst is high; otherwise increment count by one modulo 16. No other behavior is required.
Return only the complete RTL source, without Markdown or explanation. Do not include a testbench, includes, preprocessor directives, file I/O, system tasks, DPI, delays, initial blocks, or additional modules.","interface":{"top":"counter","ports":[{"name":"clk","direction":"input","width":1},{"name":"rst","direction":"input","width":1},{"name":"count","direction":"output","width":4}]},"constraints":"SystemVerilog; xczu3eg-sbva484-1-e; 5 ns clk; seed 1."},"current":{"revision_id":"f6ddd61f-82af-42a7-8c10-098155b10331","source_sha256":"887da1ae37112c6a5bfb0eb0dc9b64d9e58eace17cac8e3943084e7933ad4e73","source":"module counter (
    input  wire       clk,
    input  wire       rst,
    output reg  [3:0] count
);

    always @(posedge clk) begin
        if (rst)
            count <= 4'b0000;
        else
            count <= count + 4'b0001;
    end

endmodule
